msgstr "No semantic difference."

msgid "triton.language.extra.ascend.libdevice.index_select_simd"
msgstr "triton.language.extra.ascend.libdevice.index_select_simd"

msgid "在非尾轴维度上并行 gather 多个索引，并以 tile 为单位将数据零拷贝地从全局内存（GM）直接搬运到统一缓冲区（UB）的正确位置。该操作等效于 `torch.index_select` 的高性能实现，适用于嵌入层查找、稀疏索引访问等场景。"
msgstr "Parallel gather multiple indices on non-tail axis dimensions, and directly copy data from global memory (GM) to the correct positions in the unified buffer (UB) in units of tiles with zero-copy. This operation is equivalent to a high-performance implementation of `torch.index_select`, suitable for scenarios such as embedding layer lookup and sparse index access."

msgid "`triton.language.extra.ascend.libdevice.index_select_simd(src, dim, index, src_shape, src_offset, read_shape)`"
msgstr "`triton.language.extra.ascend.libdevice.index_select_simd(src, dim, index, src_shape, src_offset, read_shape)`"

msgid "在源张量的指定维度上，根据索引数组批量读取数据"
msgstr "Read data in batches from the specified dimension of the source tensor according to the index array."

msgid "支持指定读取区域的偏移和大小，实现灵活的切片"
msgstr "Supports specifying the offset and size of the read region for flexible slicing."

msgid "零拷贝高效实现，直接从 GM 搬运到 UB"
msgstr "Zero-copy efficient implementation, directly transferring from GM to UB."

msgid "保持元素类型和编码方式不变"
msgstr "Keep the element type and encoding unchanged."

msgid "**典型应用场景：**"
msgstr "**Typical Application Scenarios:**"

msgid "嵌入层（Embedding）查找：从大词汇表中根据 token ID 批量读取词向量"
msgstr "Embedding layer lookup: batch reading word vectors from a large vocabulary based on token IDs."

msgid "稀疏张量操作：根据稀疏索引访问密集张量的特定行"
msgstr "Sparse tensor operation: access specific rows of a dense tensor based on sparse indices"

msgid "动态路由和注意力机制：根据动态计算的索引选择特定特征"
msgstr "Dynamic routing and attention mechanism: selecting specific features based on dynamically computed indices"

msgid "src"
msgstr "src"

msgid "tensor/pointer"
msgstr "tensor/pointer"

msgid "源张量指针，位于全局内存（GM）上的数据"
msgstr "Source tensor pointer, data located in global memory (GM)"

msgid "dim"
msgstr "dim"

msgid "int"
msgstr "int"

msgid "在哪个维度执行 index_select 操作，取值范围 [0, len(src_shape)-2]，**不支持尾轴**（最后一个维度）"
msgstr "The dimension along which the `index_select` operation is performed, with a value range of [0, len(src_shape)-2], **does not support the trailing axis** (the last dimension)."

msgid "index"
msgstr "index"

msgid "1D 索引数组，位于 UB 上，指定要读取的索引位置"
msgstr "1D index array, located on UB, specifying the index positions to read."

msgid "src_shape"
msgstr "src_shape"

msgid "Tuple[int]"
msgstr "Tuple[int]"

msgid "源张量的完整形状"
msgstr "The full shape of the source tensor"

msgid "src_offset"
msgstr "src_offset"

msgid "从哪个位置开始读取，在 dim 维度可设为 -1（该维度由 index 决定）"
msgstr "Starting position for reading, can be set to -1 in the dim dimension (this dimension is determined by the index)."

msgid "read_shape"
msgstr "read_shape"

msgid "读取数据的大小，在 dim 维度必须设为 -1（该维度由 index 长度决定）"
msgstr "The size of the data to be read must be set to -1 in the dim dimension (this dimension is determined by the index length)."

msgid "**类型：** tensor (位于 UB 上)"
msgstr "**Type:** tensor (located on UB)"

msgid "**形状：** 与 read_shape 一致，其中 dim 维度的大小等于 index 的长度"
msgstr "**Shape:** Same as `read_shape`, where the size of the `dim` dimension equals the length of `index`."

msgid "**数据类型：** 与源张量相同"
msgstr "**Data type:** Same as the source tensor"

msgid "**内存位置：** 统一缓冲区（UB）"
msgstr "**Memory Location:** Unified Buffer (UB)"

msgid "`read_shape[dim]` 必须为 -1"
msgstr "`read_shape[dim]` must be -1"

msgid "`src_offset[dim]` 可以设为 -1（会被忽略，因为该维度由 index 决定）"
msgstr "`src_offset[dim]` can be set to -1 (it will be ignored because this dimension is determined by the index)."

msgid "`len(src_shape) == len(src_offset) == len(read_shape)`"
msgstr "`len(src_shape) == len(src_offset) == len(read_shape)`"

msgid "`index` 必须是 1D 张量"
msgstr "`index` must be a 1D tensor"

msgid "`dim` 不能是尾轴（最后一个维度），即 `dim < len(src_shape) - 1`"
msgstr "`dim` cannot be the trailing axis (the last dimension), i.e., `dim < len(src_shape) - 1`."

msgid "对于非 dim 维度：`0 <= src_offset[i] < src_shape[i]`"
msgstr "For non-dim dimensions: `0 <= src_offset[i] < src_shape[i]`"

msgid "对于非 dim 维度：`src_offset[i] + read_shape[i] <= src_shape[i]`（超出边界自动截断）"
msgstr "For non-dim dimensions: `src_offset[i] + read_shape[i] <= src_shape[i]` (automatically truncated if out of bounds)"

msgid "index 中的索引值必须在 `[0, src_shape[dim])` 范围内"
msgstr "The index value in `index` must be within the range `[0, src_shape[dim])`."

msgid "N/A"
msgstr "N/A"

msgid "**说明：**"
msgstr "**Description:**"

msgid "index 的数据类型必须为 int32 或 int64"
msgstr "The data type of `index` must be int32 or int64."

msgid "GPU 平台不支持此操作（Ascend 专用 intrinsic）"
msgstr "This operation is not supported on the GPU platform (Ascend-specific intrinsic)."

msgid "支持任意维度数（1D 到高维张量），但需满足以下条件："
msgstr "Supports any number of dimensions (from 1D to high-dimensional tensors), subject to the following conditions:"

msgid "index 必须是 1D 张量"
msgstr "index must be a 1D tensor"

msgid "源张量的各维度大小需根据实际硬件内存限制"
msgstr "The size of each dimension of the source tensor must be determined based on actual hardware memory constraints."

msgid "read_shape 在非 dim 维度上的大小需考虑 UB 空间限制"
msgstr "The size of `read_shape` on non-dim dimensions must consider UB space constraints."

msgid "**常见形状组合：**"
msgstr "**Common Shape Combinations:**"

msgid "2D 张量：适用于嵌入层查找、稀疏矩阵行选择"
msgstr "2D tensor: suitable for embedding layer lookup and sparse matrix row selection"

msgid "3D 张量：适用于批量嵌入查找、序列特征提取"
msgstr "3D tensor: suitable for batch embedding lookup and sequence feature extraction"

msgid "高维张量：适用于复杂的多维索引操作"
msgstr "High-dimensional tensors: suitable for complex multi-dimensional indexing operations"

msgid "**dim 限制：** 不支持在尾轴（最后一个维度）上执行 index_select 操作，dim 必须满足 `dim < len(src_shape) - 1`"
msgstr "**dim restriction:** The `index_select` operation is not supported on the trailing axis (the last dimension); dim must satisfy `dim < len(src_shape) - 1`."

msgid "**数据类型限制：** 暂不支持 uint16/uint32/uint64/float8/float64 数据类型"
msgstr "**Data Type Limitations:** The uint16/uint32/uint64/float8/float64 data types are currently not supported."

msgid "**索引越界：** 不检查 index 中的索引是否越界，用户需自行保证索引合法性"
msgstr "**Index Out of Bounds:** The index in `index` is not checked for out-of-bounds access; users must ensure the validity of the index themselves."

msgid "**基本用法（2D 嵌入查找）：**"
msgstr "**Basic Usage (2D Embedding Lookup):**"

msgid "**与 torch.index_select 的关系：**"
msgstr "**Relationship with torch.index_select:**"

msgid "`index_select_simd` 等价于 `torch.index_select(src, dim, index)` 加上切片操作"
msgstr "`index_select_simd` is equivalent to `torch.index_select(src, dim, index)` combined with a slicing operation."

msgid "但 index_select_simd 在硬件层面实现，性能优于 PyTorch 实现（约 0.6~1.5x AscendC 性能）"
msgstr "However, `index_select_simd` is implemented at the hardware level, offering better performance than the PyTorch implementation (approximately 0.6~1.5x AscendC performance)."

msgid "**与常规 load 的差异：**"
msgstr "**Differences from regular load:**"

msgid "3 与GPU差异"
msgstr "3 Differences from GPU"

msgid "新增OP，无差异"
msgstr "New OP, no difference."

msgid "4 测试用例说明"
msgstr "4 Test Case Description"

msgid "**测试文件：**"
msgstr "**Test File:**"

msgid "`ascend/examples/pytest_ut/test_index_select.py` - 2D 张量 index_select 测试（多种形状组合）"
msgstr "`ascend/examples/pytest_ut/test_index_select.py` - 2D tensor index_select test (multiple shape combinations)"

