msgstr "Ascend compared to GPU lacks support for input tensor types uint8, uint16, uint32, uint64, fp16, fp64, bf16, and bool."

msgid "1.内联汇编的寄存器仅支持`int64(s64)` 和`float32(f32)`。 2.约束限制仅支持`l`。 3.目前仅支持输入一维张量，计算高维张量需展开。"
msgstr "1. Inline assembly registers only support `int64(s64)` and `float32(f32)`. 2. Constraint restrictions only support `l`. 3. Currently, only one-dimensional tensors are supported for input; computing high-dimensional tensors requires flattening."

msgid "triton.language.range"
msgstr "triton.language.range"

msgid "`range` 是一个向上计数的迭代器，类似于 Python 的 `range()` 函数，但是允许传入更多的参数。"
msgstr "`range` is an iterator that counts upward, similar to Python's `range()` function, but allows for more parameters to be passed."

msgid "一个整数，每次迭代的步长增量"
msgstr "An integer, the step size increment for each iteration."

msgid "禁止dot操作累加器的多缓冲优化"
msgstr "Prohibit dot operation accumulator multi-buffer optimization"

msgid "自动展平嵌套循环为单层循环"
msgstr "Automatically flatten nested loops into single-level loops."

msgid "启用warp专业化（仅Blackwell GPU）"
msgstr "Enable warp specialization (Blackwell GPU only)"

msgid "禁用循环不变代码外提优化"
msgstr "Disable loop-invariant code motion optimization"

msgid "Ascend 对比 GPU 缺失uint8、uint16、uint32、uint64、fp64的支持能力（硬件限制）。 disallow_acc_multi_buffer, flatten, warp_specialize, disable_licm 相关功能还不全。"
msgstr "Ascend lacks support for uint8, uint16, uint32, uint64, and fp64 compared to GPU (hardware limitation). The functionalities related to disallow_acc_multi_buffer, flatten, warp_specialize, and disable_licm are not yet complete."

msgid "triton.language.static_range"
msgstr "triton.language.static_range"

msgid "`static_range` 是一个静态范围的迭代器，与 `range` 类似但会在编译时进行积极的循环展开优化。"
msgstr "`static_range` is a static range iterator, similar to `range`, but performs aggressive loop unrolling optimization at compile time."

msgid "`constexpr`"
msgstr "`constexpr`"

msgid "Ascend 910系列"
msgstr "Ascend 910 series"

