"Introduction: Perform matrix multiplication on two tensors. The tensors must be two-dimensional or three-dimensional and their dimensions must be consistent. For three-dimensional blocks, `tl.dot` performs batch matrix multiplication, where the first dimension of each block represents the batch dimension.  \n"
"Prototype:\n"

