msgstr "Conclusion: In terms of Shape, there is no difference between GPU and Ascend platforms. Both lhs/rhs matrices support 2 to 3 dimensional tensors, but the scale matrix only supports 2 dimensions."

msgid "1、由于不支持fp8，左右矩阵不支持fp4、fp8格式，Ascend 对比 GPU 缺失lhs_k_pack、rhs_k_pack的矩阵解压缩支持能力（硬件限制）。 2、输入矩阵lhs、rhs推荐输入范围为[-5, 5]，超过可能会出现极值inf。 3、由于硬件存在对齐要求，需要限制scale矩阵做broadcast的倍数，至少应为16"
msgstr ""
"1. Due to the lack of fp8 support, the left and right matrices do not support fp4 and fp8 formats. Compared to GPU, Ascend lacks matrix decompression support for `lhs_k_pack` and `rhs_k_pack` (hardware limitation).  \n"
"2. The recommended input range for the lhs and rhs matrices is [-5, 5]; values outside this range may result in extreme values such as inf.  \n"
"3. Due to hardware alignment requirements, the broadcast multiplier for the scale matrix must be limited to at least 16.\n"

