msgid "triton.language.sum"
msgstr "triton.language.sum"

msgid "简介：`triton.language.sum` 计算输入tensor沿指定轴的元素和，返回求和结果。"
msgstr "Introduction: `triton.language.sum` computes the sum of elements of the input tensor along the specified axis and returns the result."

msgid "**版本差异说明**"
msgstr "**Version Differences Description**"

msgid "`dtype` 参数为社区 Triton 3.5.0 引入的功能。当前发布的 Triton-Ascend 基于社区 Triton 3.2.0 开发，没有`dtype` 参数。后续升级至社区 Triton 3.5.0 版本时，将完整支持 `dtype` 参数的功能。"
msgstr "The `dtype` parameter is a feature introduced in community Triton 3.5.0. The current release of Triton-Ascend is developed based on community Triton 3.2.0 and does not include the `dtype` parameter. When upgrading to community Triton 3.5.0 in the future, full support for the `dtype` parameter will be provided."

msgid "沿着哪个维度进行求和操作。如果为None，则对所有维度求和"
msgstr "The dimension along which the summation operation is performed. If None, sum over all dimensions."

msgid "如果为True，保持被求和的维度为长度1"
msgstr "If True, keep the summed dimension as length 1."

msgid "返回值： `tensor`：计算输入tensor沿指定轴的元素和，返回求和结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tensor`: Computes the sum of elements of the input tensor along the specified axis, returning the summation result."

msgid "相对社区能力缺失且无法实现 keep_dims=True需要测试更多规格，来确定是否全面支持。目前已测3D dim=2情况下，支持 keep_dims=True。 `dtype` 参数当前版本暂未支持。社区 Triton 3.5.0 中，`dtype` 参数用于控制求和运算的累加数据类型：未指定时，位宽小于 32 的整数类型会自动提升为 `int32`/`uint32` 以避免溢出；显式指定时，输入会先转换为指定类型再执行求和。当前 Triton-Ascend 基于社区 Triton 3.2.0，该类型提升逻辑尚未支持，将在后续升级至 3.5.0 版本时完整支持。"
msgstr "Due to missing community capabilities and the inability to implement `keep_dims=True`, more specifications need to be tested to determine full support. Currently, in the tested 3D case with `dim=2`, `keep_dims=True` is supported. The `dtype` parameter is not yet supported in the current version. In community Triton 3.5.0, the `dtype` parameter is used to control the accumulation data type for sum operations: when not specified, integer types with bit widths less than 32 are automatically promoted to `int32`/`uint32` to avoid overflow; when explicitly specified, the input is first converted to the specified type before performing the sum. The current Triton-Ascend is based on community Triton 3.2.0, and this type promotion logic is not yet supported; it will be fully supported in a subsequent upgrade to version 3.5.0."

msgid "以下示例实现了对2Dshape的tensor进行sum运算："
msgstr "The following example implements a sum operation on a 2D shape tensor:"

