msgid "kwargs – 1 个元参数字典，用于作为关键字参数传递给内核。"
msgstr "kwargs – A dictionary of meta-parameters, used to pass as keyword arguments to the kernel."

msgid "num_warps – 在为 GPU 编译时内核使用的线程数。例如，如果 num_warps=8，则每个内核实例将自动并行化，使用 8 * 32 = 256 个线程协作执行。"
msgstr "num_warps – The number of warps used by the kernel when compiling for GPU. For example, if num_warps=8, each kernel instance will be automatically parallelized and executed collaboratively using 8 * 32 = 256 threads."

msgid "num_stages – 编译器在软件流水线循环时应使用的阶段数。对于 SM80+ GPU 上的矩阵乘法工作负载非常有用。"
msgstr "num_stages – The number of stages the compiler should use when software pipelining loops. This is particularly useful for matrix multiplication workloads on SM80+ GPUs."

msgid "num_ctas - 块集群中的块数。仅适用于 SM90+。"
msgstr "num_ctas - The number of blocks in a block cluster. Only applicable for SM90+."

msgid "maxnreg - 单个线程可以使用的最大寄存器数。对应于 ptx 的 .maxnreg 指令。并非所有平台都支持。"
msgstr "maxnreg - The maximum number of registers that a single thread can use. Corresponds to the `.maxnreg` directive in PTX. Not supported on all platforms."

msgid "pre_hook – 在调用内核之前将被调用的函数。该函数的参数是 args。"
msgstr "pre_hook – A function that will be called before invoking the kernel. The parameter of this function is args."

msgid "**方法：**"
msgstr "**Method:**"

msgid "init(self, kwargs[, num_warps, ...])"
msgstr "init(self, kwargs[, num_warps, ...])"

msgid "all_kwargs (self)"
msgstr "all_kwargs (self)"

msgid "triton.autotune"
msgstr "triton.autotune"

msgid "用于自动调优 triton.jit 函数的装饰器。"
msgstr "Decorator for automatically tuning `triton.jit` functions."

msgid "注：当所有配置都被解析时，内核将运行多次。也就是说内核更新的任何值都会进行多次更新。为了避免这种不希望出现的行为，可以使用 `reset_to_zero` 参数，该参数会在运行任何配置之前将提供的张量值重置为零。"
msgstr "Note: When all configurations are parsed, the kernel will run multiple times. This means that any values updated by the kernel will be updated multiple times. To avoid this undesired behavior, the `reset_to_zero` parameter can be used, which resets the provided tensor values to zero before running any configuration."

msgid "注：如果环境变量 `TRITON_PRINT_AUTOTUNING` 设置为 `\"1\"`，Triton 会在每次自动调优内核后向标准输出 (stdout) 打印一条消息，包括自动调优所花费的时间和最佳配置。"
msgstr "Note: If the environment variable `TRITON_PRINT_AUTOTUNING` is set to `\"1\"`, Triton will print a message to stdout after each autotuning kernel, including the time spent on autotuning and the best configuration."

msgid "**参数：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

msgid "`configs (list[triton.Config])` - `triton.Config` 对象列表。"
msgstr "`configs (list[triton.Config])` - A list of `triton.Config` objects."

msgid "`key (list[str])` - 参数名列表，当值发生改变时将触发对所有配置的解析。"
msgstr "`key (list[str])` - A list of parameter names; when the value changes, it will trigger parsing of all configurations."

msgid "`prune_configs_by (dict)` - 修剪配置的函数字典。包含以下字段："
msgstr "`prune_configs_by (dict)` - A dictionary of functions for pruning configurations. Contains the following fields:"

msgid "`'perf_model'`: 性能模型，用于预测不同配置的运行时间，返回运行时间"
msgstr "`'perf_model'`: A performance model used to predict the runtime of different configurations, returning the runtime."

msgid "`'top_k'`: 要进行基准测试的配置数量"
msgstr "`'top_k'`: The number of configurations to benchmark."

msgid "`'early_config_prune'`（可选）: 用于提前修剪配置的函数（例如，`num_stages`）。它接收 `configs: List[Config]` 作为输入，并返回修剪后的配置"
msgstr "`'early_config_prune'` (optional): A function for early pruning of configurations (e.g., `num_stages`). It takes `configs: List[Config]` as input and returns the pruned configurations."

msgid "`reset_to_zero (list[str])` - 参数名称列表，将在任何配置解析之前被重置为零。"
msgstr "`reset_to_zero (list[str])` - A list of parameter names that will be reset to zero before any configuration parsing."

msgid "`restore_value (list[str])` - 参数名称列表，这些参数的值将在解析任何配置之后恢复。"
msgstr "`restore_value (list[str])` - A list of parameter names whose values will be restored after parsing any configuration."

msgid "`pre_hook (lambda args, reset_only)` - 一个将在调用内核之前被调用的函数。该参数会覆盖 `reset_to_zero` 和 `restore_value` 的默认 `pre_hook`。"
msgstr "`pre_hook (lambda args, reset_only)` - A function that will be called before the kernel is invoked. This parameter overrides the default `pre_hook` for `reset_to_zero` and `restore_value`."

msgid "`args`：传递给内核的参数列表"
msgstr "`args`: The list of arguments passed to the kernel."

msgid "`reset_only`：一个布尔值，表示 `pre_hook` 是否仅用于重置值，而没有对应的 `post_hook`"
msgstr "`reset_only`: A boolean indicating whether the `pre_hook` is only used to reset values without a corresponding `post_hook`."

msgid "`post_hook (lambda args, exception)` - 一个将在调用内核之后被调用的函数。该参数会覆盖 `restore_value` 的默认 `post_hook`。"
msgstr "`post_hook (lambda args, exception)` - A function that will be called after the kernel is invoked. This parameter overrides the default `post_hook` of `restore_value`."

msgid "`exception`：在出现编译或运行时错误情况下，由内核引发的异常"
msgstr "`exception`: An exception raised by the kernel in the event of a compilation or runtime error."

msgid "`warmup (int)` - 传递给基准测试的预热时间（以毫秒为单位），默认值为 25。"
msgstr "`warmup (int)` - The warm-up time passed to the benchmark (in milliseconds), with a default value of 25."

msgid "`rep (int)` - 传递给基准测试的重复时间（以毫秒为单位），默认值为 100。"
msgstr "`rep (int)` - The repetition time passed to the benchmark (in milliseconds), default value is 100."

msgid "`use_cuda_graph (bool)` - 是否使用 CUDA Graph 进行性能测量（默认为 `False`）。"
msgstr "`use_cuda_graph (bool)` - Whether to use CUDA Graph for performance measurement (default is `False`)."

msgid "triton.heuristics"
msgstr "triton.heuristics"

msgid "用于指定如何计算某些元参数值的装饰器。这在自动调优成本过高或不适用的情况下非常有用。"
msgstr "Decorator used to specify how certain meta-parameter values are computed. This is useful in cases where auto-tuning is too expensive or not applicable."

msgid "**参数：** `values (dict[str, Callable[[list[Any]], Any]]**)` - 包含元参数名称和计算元参数值的函数的字典。每个这样的函数都接受一个位置参数列表作为输入。"
msgstr "**Parameters:** `values (dict[str, Callable[[list[Any]], Any]]**)` - A dictionary containing metaparameter names and functions that compute metaparameter values. Each such function accepts a list of positional arguments as input."

